---
manual: events.start
lines: [2286, 2289]
testability: api
display: native
ledger: H8
expect: fail
reason: Lacci slots have no start; inside a slot block start registers on the App, which calls it with the App (ledger H8)
----------- app code
$started = []
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 300 do
  $slot = stack width: 100, height: 50 do
    start { |slot| $started << slot }
  end
  @redraw = button("Redraw") { $slot.hide; $slot.show }
end
----------- test code
wait_frames 1
assert_equal [$slot], $started, "start ran when the slot was first drawn, handed the slot"

click_on button("@redraw")
wait_frames 2
assert_equal [$slot], $started, "drawing it again does not start it again"
